</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/fb3cad42-916c-11f1-9070-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-06T021534Z-837598977-RC2OSMAYG7DW-RTRMADP-3-WW2-ANNIVERSARY-HIROSHIMA.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/fb3cad42-916c-11f1-9070-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-06T021534Z-837598977-RC2OSMAYG7DW-RTRMADP-3-WW2-ANNIVERSARY-HIROSHIMA.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">3a95f2e0-916e-11f1-b7a5-1f94adf76d39</guid><pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 08:10:12 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/fb3cad42-916c-11f1-9070-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-06T021534Z-837598977-RC2OSMAYG7DW-RTRMADP-3-WW2-ANNIVERSARY-HIROSHIMA.jpg">REUTERS - Issei Kato</source><dc:creator>东京特约记者 楚良一</dc:creator></item><item><category>欧洲</category><title>俄近30枚导弹炸基辅 “爱国者”防空导弹议题变中有变</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E6%AC%A7%E6%B4%B2/20260805-%E4%BF%84%E8%BF%9130%E6%9E%9A%E5%AF%BC%E5%BC%B9%E7%82%B8%E5%9F%BA%E8%BE%85-%E7%88%B1%E5%9B%BD%E8%80%85-%E9%98%B2%E7%A9%BA%E5%AF%BC%E5%BC%B9%E8%AE%AE%E9%A2%98%E5%8F%98%E4%B8%AD%E6%9C%89%E5%8F%98</link><description>
